{"scope":"knowledge","page":61,"pageSize":24,"total":1502,"totalPages":63,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b880c5d4bd11","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"因果节拍法（causal beats）——让剧情「有逻辑地上头」，不是流水账","description":"> 剧情简单/散，多半是「然后…然后…」的流水账。好剧本是**因果链**：每个节拍都由上一个 > **导致**，主角的选择推动下一步。本文给单集的因果节拍模板 + 爽点密度要求，配合 > `genre-hooks-handbook.md`（选题材/钩子）与 `four-act-drama.md`（四幕结构）使用。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/causal-beats.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b9c45958674c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"视频提示词审查量表与合成案例","description":"1. 审查顺序 2. 证据量表 3. 完成前结构检查 4. 合成正例 5. 合成反例","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/review-and-fixtures.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ba869b3010dd","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"契约与所有权","description":"```text 开发? -> 剧本 -> 视觉设定 -> 图片提示词 \\-> 分镜 -> 视频提示词 \\-> 明确确认后的媒体生产 ```","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/contract-and-ownership.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-bb5e2f6076f8","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"Story And Script Rubric","description":"audience payoff without relying on a genre label? misunderstanding, humiliation, rescue, or reveal?","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/refer