"pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c7eb7a3f0823","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"Adapter Contract","description":"```json { \"schema_version\": \"1.0\", \"job_id\": \"EP001-MOTION001-video\", \"modality\": \"video\", \"adapter\": \"studio-video\", \"prompt\": \"the exact copyable prompt from MOTION-EP001-001\", \"source\": \"剧集/EP001/视频提示词.md\", \"source_entry\": \"MOTION-EP001…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-produce/references/adapter-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-produce","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c95fe71dad72","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"前提装置：把外来优势写成有边界的压力","description":"前提装置是叠加在题材之上的一个开局设定：主角比处境中的其他人**多拥有一样东西**—— 一段已经发生过的记忆，或一套外部授权的能力。装置本身不提供冲突，它**取消**冲突； 所以它带来的全部工艺问题都是同一个：把取消掉的阻力用什么补回来。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/premise-devices.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-caa369807012","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"生产参考板决策：角色、场景与道具","description":"来自对角色、场景、物品资产如何进入后续镜头的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成改写。 通用方法见 [common-recipe.md](common-recipe.md)；本文档提供可按项目调整的生产版式。 核心原则：**先明确资产负责的稳定身份与当前版本，再让分镜负责本镜呈现**。纯白底、 无情绪、三视图只是便于识别的一种项目选择；带环境的背景、单视图或带状态的参考板 只要更符合复用目的且不混淆身份与临时状态，也可以由创作者选择（IMG-03/IMG-04）。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/production-sheet-recipes.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-cc316354f84b","category":